stateDiagram-v2
    direction LR

    Moving: Moving<br/>status changed recently<br/>no label
    Blocked: Blocked<br/>status — waiting on someone<br/>outside the team
    Aging: Aging<br/>label — aging
    Stale: Stale<br/>label — stale
    Resolved: Moving again, or gone<br/>resume · hand off<br/>unclaim · wontfix

    [*] --> Moving
    [*] --> Blocked: blocked before it starts
    Moving --> Blocked: an outside party has to act
    Blocked --> Moving: the block is removed
    Moving --> Aging: 3 working days, no status change
    Blocked --> Aging: 3 working days, no status change
    Aging --> Stale: 7 working days, no status change
    Aging --> Resolved: assigned engineer acts
    Stale --> Resolved: the team acts
    Resolved --> [*]

    note right of Blocked
        Ages without leaving.
        Keeps the status, takes
        the label, and shows in
        the blocked panel.
    end note

    classDef inScope fill:#0F1622,stroke:#34E0B4,stroke-width:1.5px,color:#E9F1F9
    class Moving,Blocked,Aging,Stale,Resolved inScope
